       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 10,000 mg three times daily comes to 30 g/day, which is about 7 times the usual maximum of 4 g/day for an adult. A single 10 g dose is already in the range that can cause serious hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function. At 70 kg, 10 g is about 143 mg/kg, and toxicity concern begins around 150 mg/kg.\n\nI suspect this is a typo for **1,000 mg**. Did you mean one of these?\n\n- **1,000 mg PO three times daily** (3 g/day), a standard regimen\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours**, or another regimen\n\nTell me the dose you intend and I'll enter it right away. If you really do want 10,000 mg, please confirm that and give me the clinical rationale. I'd want to put that in the order note."
